{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2018-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1527120000, "end_date": 1527811199, "month_true_total": 401, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:08:28 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "42413195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198156914587", "personaname": "Krausk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198156914587/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 825258, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 549496, "last_played": 1783470479, "avatar": "97cea1913ad35c69cb0ae85c232c98fd03ef50de"}, "language": "english", "review": "Phenomenal game, but only if you rely on community made content. The overwhelming mod support makes it for me - as well as the sheer flexibility of its creation tools. My primary word of advice to a new player is to keep your modlists rather slim until you know more about the various mods and how they interact.\n\nIf you have an itch for modding or creativity at all for things like mission design, trust me, this game will suck your soul out of you like it has me. Beware the ancient modding tools (ArmA3 Tools), though - despite their advanced functionality they are rather tedious to learn and the GUI comes out of something twenty years ago.", "timestamp_created": 1527802568, "timestamp_updated": 1645341438, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 7, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 12, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "42412487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255965637", "personaname": "MealTeamSix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/breadrebellion/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playt